 "title": "【道路舗装率2%から】なぜ東京は他の主要都市と違う狂気じみた設計で巨大都市になったのか？",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ee6UsYuBlmQ/maxresdefault.jpg",
 "description": "道路舗装率わずか2%だった日本が、なぜ世界3位・3340万人の巨大都市圏を機能させられるのか？世界の巨大都市と同じリングに立ちながら、致命的な麻痺を起こさない東京。その「異常なスケール」が生まれた理由を解説します。\n\n参考資料\n\nTOD Practice in Japan Tokyo, A Global City Created by Railways\nhttps://www.mlit.go.jp/toshi/tosiko/content/001361990.pdf\n\nWorld Urbanization Prospects 2025 Frequently Asked Questions\nhttps://population.un.org/wup/assets/Publications/undesa_pd_2025_faq_wup25.pdf\n\nChallenges in Better Coordinating Tokyo’s Urban Rail Services\nhttps://www.oecd.org/content/dam/oecd/en/publications/reports/2016/09/challenges-in-better-co-ordinating-tokyo-s-urban-rail-services_4906d996/64260e61-en.pdf\n\nThe Research on Integrated Urban Rain and Urban/Regional Development\nhttps://openjicareport.jica.go.jp/pdf/12305546.pdf\n\nSubcentres and Satellite Cities: Tokyo’s 20th CenturyExperience of Planned Polycentrism\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/253856915_Subcentres_and_Satellite_Cities_Tokyo%27s_20th_Century_Experience_of_Planned_Polycentrism\n\nIntegrated Corridor Management Dhaka North Project\nhttps://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/099300006232222667/pdf/P1777020b38220040a9490dbfb31f656f5.pdf\n\n都市集積の経済と地域間格差\nhttps://www.esri.cao.go.jp/jp/esri/esr/esr_report/esr_007/esr_007_e.pdf\n\nMICRO-FOUNDATIONS OF URBAN AGGLOMERATION ECONOMIES\nhttps://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w9931/w9931.pdf\n\nDecentralization and Urban Governance: Reforming Tokyo Metropolitan Government\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/237364587_Decentralization_and_Urban_Governance_Reforming_Tokyo_Metropolitan_Government\n\n戦前の私鉄 における兼業の役割 に関する実証的研究\nhttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/journalhs1990/15/0/15_0_187/_pdf/-char/en\n\n戦前期 における郊外住宅地開発 と私鉄の戦略\nhttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jjhg1948/55/5/55_5_492/_pdf/-char/ja\n\nThe Development of Tokyo’s Rail Network\nhttps://www.ejrcf.or.jp/jrtr/jrtr23/pdf/F22_Hirooka.pdf\n\nPost-Suburban Tokyo? Urbanization, Suburbanization, Reurbanization\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/269037684_Post-Suburban_Tokyo_Urbanization_Suburbanization_Reurbanization\n\nTechnological Innovation and the Development of Transportation in Japan\nhttps://d-arch.ide.go.jp/je_archive/english/society/book_jes6_d01_02_02.html\n\nCASE STUDY ON TERRITORIAL DEVELOPMENT IN JAPAN\nhttps://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/434651560830510154/pdf/Case-Study-on-Territorial-Development-in-Japan.pdf\n\n国土技術政策総合研究所研究資料\nhttps://www.nilim.go.jp/lab/bcg/siryou/tnn/tnn0776pdf/ks077604.pdf\n\n\n【お知らせ】いつも応援ありがとうございます。\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
